{"id":"3918298","slug":"josh-allen","name":"Josh Allen","position":"QB","team":"BUF","headshot":"https://a.espncdn.com/i/headshots/nfl/players/full/3918298.png","formats":{"ppr-12":{"positionRank":1,"ourRank":24,"vorRound":2,"adp":32.4,"projected":195.3125646210847,"vor":52.32305910559785,"expectedGames":9.009746458482953,"floor":null,"median":null,"ceiling":null,"tier":1,"preseasonRank":28,"preseasonPoints":307.3},"half-ppr-12":{"positionRank":1,"ourRank":21,"vorRound":2,"adp":29.7,"projected":194.75907421949697,"vor":51.79934611678999,"expectedGames":9.009746458482953,"floor":null,"median":null,"ceiling":null,"tier":1,"preseasonRank":17,"preseasonPoints":336.8},"standard-12":{"positionRank":1,"ourRank":17,"vorRound":2,"adp":27.2,"projected":194.20558381790917,"vor":51.275633127982076,"expectedGames":9.009746458482953,"floor":null,"median":null,"ceiling":null,"tier":1,"preseasonRank":25,"preseasonPoints":299.8}},"capsule":{"body":"Three straight seasons finishing first or second at the position, and he did it while never missing a game to injury or a reserve list, 16 games in each of the last two years and all 17 in 2023. Last year he beat the weekly median in 13 of 16 weeks and averaged 22.8 a game. Even the dud was just one 7.1 in week 16.\n\nWhat actually separates him from the other early quarterbacks is the goal-line work. Sixteen touches inside the ten, more than anyone at the position, and 19 red-zone touches, one spot behind Jalen Hurts. That is rushing value a pocket passer never gets, and it held up even in a Buffalo offense that threw on only 51% of situation-neutral plays. It is also why our number stays at 307 points, about 13 better than the historical output of quarterbacks drafted around pick 32, even after two knocks: he turns 30.3 on opening day in his ninth season, and Joe Brady is new as head coach this year. We project 15 games with a realistic range of 9 to 17, a modest haircut, not a warning. The low end of the full tails, 208, comes only from seasons cut short by injury, not something we expect.\n\nDrafters already see it, ADP climbing nine picks since early September to around 24. He is QB1 on our board. Pay the cost, take him in the late second or early third, and build the rest of your draft knowing the quarterback spot is done.","pulls":[{"figure":"307","caption":"projected PPR points"},{"figure":"208","caption":"PPR points in his floor season"},{"figure":"32","caption":"his ADP in PPR drafts"}]},"season":{"season":2026,"format":"ppr-12","weeks":18,"through":5,"games":5,"pointsPerGame":28.2,"totals":{"pass_attempts":138.0,"completions":91.0,"passing_yards":1249.0,"passing_touchdowns":7.0,"interceptions":4.0,"carries":43.0,"rushing_yards":239.0,"rushing_touchdowns":8.0,"targets":1.0,"receptions":1.0,"receiving_yards":1.0,"receiving_touchdowns":0.0,"fumbles_lost":1.0,"field_goals_made":0.0,"extra_points_made":0.0,"sacks":0.0,"defensive_interceptions":0.0,"defensive_touchdowns":0.0,"snapShare":1.0,"points":140.96},"log":[{"pass_attempts":29.0,"completions":20.0,"passing_yards":334.0,"passing_touchdowns":2.0,"interceptions":0.0,"carries":6.0,"rushing_yards":23.0,"rushing_touchdowns":2.0,"targets":0.0,"receptions":0.0,"receiving_yards":0.0,"receiving_touchdowns":0.0,"fumbles_lost":0.0,"field_goals_made":0.0,"extra_points_made":0.0,"sacks":0.0,"defensive_interceptions":0.0,"defensive_touchdowns":0.0,"snapShare":1.0,"points":35.66,"week":1,"opponent":"HOU","home":false,"status":"played"},{"pass_attempts":31.0,"completions":20.0,"passing_yards":248.0,"passing_touchdowns":3.0,"interceptions":0.0,"carries":14.0,"rushing_yards":69.0,"rushing_touchdowns":2.0,"targets":0.0,"receptions":0.0,"receiving_yards":0.0,"receiving_touchdowns":0.0,"fumbles_lost":0.0,"field_goals_made":0.0,"extra_points_made":0.0,"sacks":0.0,"defensive_interceptions":0.0,"defensive_touchdowns":0.0,"snapShare":1.0,"points":40.82,"week":2,"opponent":"DET","home":true,"status":"played"},{"pass_attempts":26.0,"completions":16.0,"passing_yards